---
/**
 * Consulting page: intro section.
 * Hidden on every screen size (kept as it was on the WordPress page).
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-7a7c9f8 vb-hidden-desktop vb-hidden-tablet vb-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="7a7c9f8"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-8606354 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="8606354"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-f93cc13 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
        data-id="f93cc13"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <p class="p1">
            At VentureBean, we partner with <b
              >SMBs, family-owned businesses, founder-led companies, and growth-stage organisations</b
            > to build the systems, leadership capability, and business structures required for sustainable growth.
          </p><p class="p2">
            Whether you are looking to improve business performance, streamline operations, strengthen leadership,
            prepare for expansion, or accelerate growth, we help turn strategy into measurable results.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-2bb152b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="2bb152b"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
      data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-f2009fa vb-icon-list--layout-traditional vb-list-item-link-full_width vb-widget vb-widget-icon-list"
        data-id="f2009fa"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-list.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <ul class="vb-icon-list-items">
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item"><span class="vb-icon-list-text">OUR EXPERTISE</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-2d72f79 vb-icon-list--layout-traditional vb-list-item-link-full_width vb-widget vb-widget-icon-list"
        data-id="2d72f79"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-list.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <ul class="vb-icon-list-items">
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Accelerate Business Growth</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Strengthen Sales, Business Development capability</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Improve Productivity, Profitability &amp; Performance</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Strategic Finance, Diligence</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Enhance Operational Efficiency</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Build up Leadership Capability, People processes</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Reduce Founder, Management Dependency</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Build Scalable Business Systems</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Improve Business Governance</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Prepare for Sustainable Scale</span>
            </li>
            <li class="vb-icon-list-item">
              <span class="vb-icon-list-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="far fa-check-circle"></i> </span>
              <span class="vb-icon-list-text">Increase Business Resilience, Continuity</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
